! test_Moon-restart: continue the nightly test_Moon regression from the particle
! restart file that its test-mode build writes after the last iteration
! (srcMoon/main.cpp; MakefileTest/Table copies it into the run directory).
!
! The physics and numerics must be those of test_Moon itself, otherwise the
! restarted state is continued with a different model.  Therefore this file
! includes the production moon.input and only adds the particle recovery; it
! must not be a separate copy of an older moon.input.  (moon.input ends with
! '#end'; ampsConfig.pl treats the '#end' of an included file as the end of
! that file only, so the block below is processed.)

#include input/moon.input

#General
  RecoverParticleData=on  \\ !on, off
    file=ParticleData.restart
#endGeneral

#end
